# The dev container is built with the repository as its context, because the Dockerfile copies
# pyproject.toml and uv.lock from here, and .devcontainer/llvm-headers.sh; the context directory
# .devcontainer/ cannot reach the first two.
# Everything else stays out: the build trees and .pio directories make a working copy several
# hundred megabytes, all of which would be sent to the daemon on every build for three files.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.devcontainer/llvm-headers.sh
